 "readme": "\n\n<!-- AUGMENTATION_METRICS_START -->\n\n## Data Augmentation & Statistical Validation\n\nTo train highly accurate, lightweight classification models suitable for remote and everyday patient use, the initial dataset required scaling. A data augmentation pipeline was applied to expand the cohort while strictly preserving the underlying biomechanical realities.\n\n### Dataset Scaling\n* **Original Data:** 102 subjects\n* **Synthetic Data:** 2916 generated rows\n* **Total Master Dataset:** 3018 rows\n\n### Statistical Fidelity Metrics\nThe augmented dataset underwent rigorous statistical validation. The synthetic data successfully respects the natural boundaries of the real data without producing impossible patient profiles.\n\n* **KS-Test Mismatches:** 0 out of 12 features (Distribution shape match)\n* **Average Mean Variance:** 2.41% (Target: < 5%)\n* **Average Std Dev Variance:** 3.91% (Target: < 5%)\n* **Mean Absolute Correlation Shift:** 0.0706 (Target: < 0.10)\n\n**Conclusion:** The augmented master dataset maintains high structural and relational integrity, successfully clearing the data for robust predictive modeling.\n\n![Mentor Validation Dashboard](data/mentor_validation_dashboard.png)\n\n<!-- AUGMENTATION_METRICS_END -->\n",
